    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/139121.png\" style=\"width: 349px; height: 163px;\" /><br /><br />coefficient of restitution <math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">u</mtext><mtext>&#160;cos</mtext><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mtext>&#160;sin</mtext><mi>&#952;</mi></math> ... (1)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">v</mtext><mtext>&#160;cos</mtext><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>u</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mtext>sin</mtext><mi>&#952;</mi></math>&nbsp;......(2)</p><p>From (1) and (2)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mtext>tan</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mtext>tan</mtext><mn>-1</mn></msup><mfenced><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfenced></math></p>",
